    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">You are an ant on a solid regular cube with a side length of 1. You can walk freely on the cube's surface.<br><br>You are given a tour of <var>n</var> corner numbers. You start at the first corner of the tour and visit all remaining corners of the tour in the tour's sequence. The tour stops at the last tour corner. A tour may or may not start and end at the same corner. A tour can also visit the same corners multiple times.<br><br>The cube's corners are numbered as depicted here:<br><pre style=\"font-family: monospace\"></pre><pre style=\"font-family: monospace\"><br>   8----------7<br>  /|         /|<br> / |        / |<br>4----------3  |<br>|  |       |  |<br>|  5-------|--6<br>| /        | /<br>|/         |/<br>1----------2<br></pre><pre style=\"font-family: monospace\"></pre><br>Or if you prefer an image:  https://postimg.cc/PpNvDXjt<br><br>Find and output the shortest total length of the tour. The length has to be rounded to 3 decimal digits.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> The tour string containing the <var>n</var> corner numbers (each between <const>1</const> and <const>8</const>)</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> The length of the shortest possible path for the tour, rounded to <const>3</const> decimal places</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\"><const>0</const> &lt; <var>n</var> &lt;= <const>200</const></div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">12</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">1.000</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
